OL,3,GNEWSAWoman died after suffering 55%
OL,4,Aburns when paint can exploded in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman died three months after
OL,7,Fsuffering severe burns when a paint
OL,8,Fcanister exploded in a garden fire.
OL,10,FKatie Louise Marshall, 32, of Vaughan
OL,11,FWilliams Drive, Newport, died at
OL,12,FBristol Royal Infirmary on 24
OL,13,FSeptember.
OL,15,FIn June, she put a black bin bag
OL,16,Fcontaining rubbish and a paint canister
OL,17,Fon the fire she had lit in her garden,
OL,18,FGwent Coroner's Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
