OL,3,GNEWSAWoman died after suffering 55%
OL,4,Aburns when paint can exploded in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe canister exploded, and a neighbour
OL,7,Fraised the alarm. Marshall was
OL,8,Finitially taken to the Grange Hospital
OL,9,Fin Cwmbran but then moved to Morriston
OL,10,FHospital, Swansea, after suffering
OL,11,F45-55% burns.
